    "text": "We download BEA Make-Use Tables, match to Compustat by NAICS assuming 5 year lag, compute returns within BEA 70 industries. Then match each industry-year to matched-industry weights corresponding to IO tables as follows: for supplier mom, industry comes from cols of Use table, matched industries from the rows. For customer mom: industry from rows of make table, matched industries from cols.",
